<title>AUSTRALIA: RALLYING-AUSTRALIAN RALLY LATEST POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-AUSTRALIAN RALLY LATEST POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>Saturday's 10 special stages in the Rally of Australia, seventh</p>
<p>round of the world championship:</p>
<p> 1. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer 1 hour 50 minutes</p>
<p>40 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort		   37 seconds</p>
<p>behind</p>
<p> 3. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza	 40</p>
<p> 4. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza	     56</p>
<p> 5. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi Lancer    1:17</p>
<p> 6. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort		1:47</p>
<p> 7. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza	    4:28</p>
<p> 8. Possum Bourne (New Zealand) Subaru Impreza   4:29</p>
<p> 9. Yoshio Fujimoto (Japan) Toyota Celica	 10:26</p>
<p> 10. Uwe Nittel (Germany) Mitsubishi Lancer     11:09</p>
